<title>USA: Miller Inds cannot explain trading activity.</title>
<headline>Miller Inds cannot explain trading activity.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller Industries Inc said Tuesday it was unaware of any corporate development that would explain the recent unusual activity in its stock.</p>
<p>The company issued the statement in reponse to a request by the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>More than 800,000 Miller shares had been traded by mid-afternoon Tuesday. The stock was off 5/8 at 16-5/8.</p>
<p>Miller Industries is a manufacturer of vehicle towing and recovery equipment in North America and Europe.</p>
